<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.4">
<l>kūṉṟoḻuttai citakuraippak koṭiyavaḷvāyk kaṭiyacolkēṭ</l>
<l>ṭīṉṟeṭutta tāyaraiyu mirācciyamu māṅkoḻiya</l>
<l>kāṉtoṭutta neṟipōkik kaṇṭakaraik kaḷaintāṉūr</l>
<l>tēntoṭutta malarccōlait tiruvaraṅka meṉpatuvē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city of him who,</l>
<l rend="indent">upon hearing the harsh words</l>
<l rend="indent">from the mouth the cruel woman</l>
<l rend="indent">that had been spoken by [her] sinful humpback slave,</l>
<l>left [his] kingdom and the mother who bore and raised [him]</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] having taken the dense forest path,</l>
<l rend="indent">exterminated the Kaṇṭakas,</l>
<l>is called holy Araṅkam with groves</l>
<l rend="indent">[full of] blossoms heavy with honey.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
